":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114186","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114186","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114186.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114186.patch","merged_at":"2026-01-28T18:33:11Z"},"body":"Whilst working on #114185 I noticed that there wasn't highlighting support yet. What this addition does is highlight all variables of the one your cursor is on like in this example:\r\n<img width=\"441\" height=\"129\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/df127365-e7a6-4849-aa0a-ea96f37ce96c\" />\r\n\r\nFor people who want to test this in NeoVim and haven't highlighting enabled:\r\n`:lua vim.api.nvim_create_autocmd({\"CursorHold\",\"CursorHoldI\"},{buffer=0,callback=vim.lsp.buf.document_highlight}); vim.api.nvim_create_autocmd(\"CursorMoved\",{buffer=0,callback=vim.lsp.buf.clear_references}); vim.opt.updatetime=200`\r\n\r\nIt's another small addition to the language server, but one which some people might want as it could be useful in certain situations.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_typ